I use a sort of embellishment on this. When I come across a box or chest,
I name all my  unidentified gems "crap", then dump them into the box and
kick the hell out of it. Any glass breaks and stays IDed as "crap." What's
left over I name "valuable." That way I know when I run across something
I've previously identified. I saw this method posted here a few months ago,
but don't remember who posted it, so can't give credit where it's due,
I'm afraid.


